10:34.460 --> 10:35.990
Separuh Syaitan, Lu Sheng.

10:36.060 --> 10:36.580
Ya.

10:37.340 --> 10:38.340
Rasanya Dewa Terhormat Luoge

10:38.340 --> 10:40.100
